{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"sase-fb:000001:issue_created:sase-fb:b5cf3ba20b9e895dfe103b495d19f48aee7f882529f31bf2f49b56e2679bf85f","timestamp":"2026-08-05T19:45:38Z","actor":"bbugyi200.athena.t9","operation":"issue_created","issue_id":"sase-fb","payload":{"kind":"issue_created","issue":{"id":"sase-fb","title":"Stop silently losing agent bead closes written in ephemeral workspaces","status":"open","issue_type":"plan","tier":"epic","parent_id":null,"owner":"bryanbugyi34@gmail.com","assignee":"","created_at":"2026-08-05T19:45:38Z","created_by":"bbugyi200.athena.t9","updated_at":"2026-08-05T19:45:38Z","closed_at":null,"close_reason":null,"description":"A `sase bead close` run by an agent inside a numbered workspace either reaches the canonical bead store or fails loudly. The CLI never prints `✓ Closed` for a mutation that exists only in a workspace-local sidecar clone, workspace eviction can never destroy unpublished canonical bead commits, and the post-completion finalizer verifies published state instead of the local projection.","notes":"","design":"plans:202608/bead_close_publication_loss.md","model":"","is_ready_to_work":false,"changespec_name":"","changespec_bug_id":"","dependencies":[]}}}
